    <briefdescription>
<para>Pricing engine for European discrete geometric average-strike Asian option. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class implements a discrete geometric average-strike Asian option, with European exercise. The formula is from &quot;Asian
       Option&quot;, E. Levy (1997) in &quot;Exotic Options: The State of the
       Art&quot;, edited by L. Clewlow, C. Strickland, pag 65-97</para><para><xrefsect id="test_1_test000088"><xreftitle>Tests</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>the correctness of the returned value is tested by reproducing known good results.</para></listitem></itemizedlist>
</para></xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>    </detaileddescription>
